{"id":"kriegen","lemma":"kriegen","pos":"verb","rank":390,"glosses":["to get","to catch, to come down with","to get (something to a desired state)"],"ipa":"/ˈkriːɡən/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5b/De-kriegen.ogg/De-kriegen.ogg.mp3","conjugation":{"indicative":{"present":{"1s":"kriege","1p":"kriegen","2s":"kriegst","2p":"kriegt","3s":"kriegt","3p":"kriegen"},"preterite":{"1s":"kriegte","1p":"kriegten","2s":"kriegtest","2p":"kriegtet","3s":"kriegte","3p":"kriegten"},"perfect":{"1s":"habe gekriegt","1p":"haben gekriegt","2s":"hast gekriegt","2p":"habt gekriegt","3s":"hat gekriegt","3p":"haben gekriegt"},"future":{"1s":"werde kriegen","1p":"werden kriegen","2s":"wirst kriegen","2p":"werdet kriegen","3s":"wird kriegen","3p":"werden kriegen"}},"imperative":{"affirmative":{"2s":"krieg","2p":"kriegt"}},"subjunctive":{"conditional":{"1s":"würde kriegen","1p":"würden kriegen","2s":"würdest kriegen","2p":"würdet kriegen","3s":"würde kriegen","3p":"würden kriegen"}}},"nonFinite":{"participle":"gekriegt"},"formAudio":{"kriege":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Kriege.wav","krieg":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/36/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Krieg.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Dieses Mal kriegen wir es.","en":"We'll get it this time.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/759906","words":[{"g":"this one, this","l":"dieser"},{"g":"just / once"},null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"it"}]},{"text":"Hast du meine Blumen gekriegt?","en":"Did you get my flowers?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/698474","words":[{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},{"g":"flower (small","l":"Blume"},null]},{"text":"Ich muss das kriegen.","en":"I have to get that.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to have to","l":"müssen"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Das kriegst du noch besser hin.","en":"You can do better than that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/700302","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"},{"g":"gone , left, situated"}]},{"text":"Ich werde nehmen, was ich kriegen kann.","en":"I'll take what I can get.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/701250","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"to take"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"I"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"}]}]}